-- Elementary cardinality facts for finite sets: the empty set, singletons,
-- pairs, inserting and removing a point, equipotence, and the counts of
-- products, disjoint sums, and power sets as equations about cardinality
-- Part of Cumulus, the Grace17 mathematics library.
